From 130ae8b7882db86f2982a971150b6ef6bcf602b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Skilltimate <skilltimate.studio@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:04:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Review fixes: close staff takeover path, college checks,
 answer-key leak

Security
- A TPO with the Users permission could create a super admin, promote any
  account (their own included) to super admin, and reset the super admin's
  password (returned in the response). Confirmed against the live code.
  lib/staff-policy.ts now enforces role ranks, own-college only and no
  self-promotion on create, edit, password reset and delete.
- 12 edit/delete routes (exams incl. hold and extra time, students, sections,
  categories, questions) check the record's college; another college's id
  answers 404 so ids cannot be probed.
- Results and the answer key unlock only after end + extra time + holds;
  they used to unlock at the raw end time while students were still writing.
- Student tokens expire after 30 days (STUDENT_TOKEN_MAX_AGE_MS); the student
  dashboard signs out cleanly on 401.
- PATCH /tenants/:id writes known fields only.

Performance
- Live Monitor: the 2s staleness clock lives in its own banner, so it no
  longer re-renders the whole table; a static icon replaces ~1,100 spinners.
- Dashboard and exam report read only the columns they use; question count
  done by the database.
- Code editor highlighting memoized (it re-ran every second for the timer).

Verified: 474 tests pass on Bun 1.1.38, 1.2.0, 1.2.20 and 1.4.4; API
typecheck clean; web typecheck at the 56-error baseline; verify:scale and
verify:option-order pass; attack script refused 10/10 (all 10 succeed on the
live code) with normal admin work unaffected, on Bun 1.1.38 and 1.2.0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
